# A journey opened brings its own sound, gliding in over two seconds from the one playing: FAR SIDE's vast
# tide, its drone, the voices that come and go. LOCKED (a knob on JOURNEY, right), the sound playing stays and
# a journey brings its scenes alone; the lock is kept through a power cut. Unlocked again (left), the next
# one opened brings its own.
autoplay 0
wait 300
expect journey 1
expect tide0 64
expect shape11 75
expect dswell 31
expect sound_lock 0
tap LFO
turn SELECT 5
tap SEL
wait 200
expect journey 6
expect nscenes 4
wait 1000
expect tide0 >64
expect tide0 <127
wait 2000
expect tide0 127
expect shape11 60
expect shape13 100
expect dswell 22
expect vcur 3
shot journey_lock.png
turn K1 1
wait 100
expect sound_lock 1
turn SELECT -4
tap SEL
wait 3000
expect journey 2
expect nscenes 3
expect tide0 127
expect shape11 60
expect dswell 22
expect pan1 52
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect sound_lock 1
expect journey 2
tap LFO
turn K2 -1
wait 100
expect sound_lock 0
turn SELECT 2
tap SEL
wait 3000
expect journey 4
expect tide0 112
expect shape11 86
expect dswell 0
expect clips 0
